  "details": "The mutuals button in the quick menu can become unresponsive. But the button in the main menu after going into someones profile works.\n\nThis happened after having mutuals disabled on launch. And then enabling it while in game. \n\nMoving worlds or toggling it off and then on again didn't solve the problem. Next launch all was working as expected again.\n\nAdded a video of me not being able to click the button.",
